   "firstViewTextSample": "energy\nProduct\nWorkflows\nEnterprise\nPricing\nBlog\nDownload for macOS\nEnergy for teams\nWork at the speed\nof thought.\n\nAn AI assistant for every employee. It works in the tools your team already uses, and IT stays in control.\n\nDownload for macOS\n\nAvailable for Windows\n\nBook a demo\nFinance and Operations\nE-commerce\nGrowth and Marketing\nPeople and HR\nIT and Onboarding\nWatch the Finance and Operations demo\n\nFinance and Operations\nMatches a payment to the invoice still marked overdue\n1:18\n\nTailored demo\n\nSee Energy run your workflow.\n\nTell us who you are and where you work. We’ll send you a short video of Energy doing a real task in the tools your company already uses.\n\nWork email\nLinkedIn profile\nCompany website\nSend me a demo\n\nThe five levels of AI\n\nMost AI stops halfway.\nEnergy manages the workflow.\n\nEngineers barely write code by hand anymore, because AI can reach the whole codebase. Everyone else works across tools like Outlook, Salesforce, NetSuite, and Excel. Follow one real task through each level.\n\nLevel 1\nAsk questions\nLevel 2\nBring your data\nLevel 3\nAI in one app\nLevel 4\nThe whole task\nEnergy\nLevel 5\nRuns on its own\nEnergy\n\n300 invoices are due by the 30th. Which will be paid late?\n\nAI does the whole task\n\nYou ask once. Energy works across every tool in a browser signed in as you, then brings the result back for your review.\n\n95% of the task done by AI\n\nYou ask, then review the result\n\nSalesforce\nOpen the account\nEnergy\nNetSuite\nHas the invoice been paid?\nEnergy\nOutlook\nW",
